    "description": "Sacred Music is the official hymns and music app of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints. It serves as both a digital hymnal and music player, with sheet music and audio from the hymnbook, Children\u2019s Songbook, annual youth album, and other collections.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or feedback about the app, you can open the app, go to Settings, and tap Send Feedback.",
